 1183:     done
 1184: 
 1185:     #  DENOMINATOR PINNED TO A LITERAL.  A detector that loses rows must not be able to pass
 1186:     #  by shrinking, and the count is the only thing that says so.  Raise it DELIBERATELY.
 1187:     #  Both halves pinned: 46 rows emitted AND all 46 green.
 1188:     #  *** RAISED 44 -> 46 ON THIS ROUND'S OWN PASS 2. ***  The panel found a clause-(d)
 1189:     #  floor breach: giving the TEX read decline an already-used NON-LEN latch bit
 1190:     #  (1 << 8 = SGIRE_W_UNMAP_RD) escapes a 44/44 sweep, because the detector's four
