The new `tex xbit` setup has an argument mismatch: its six added calls pass the intended register value as the third argument to `store()`, but that parameter is `op`; `val` is fourth. Those calls therefore do not perform the writes described by the “ALL ELEVEN” annotation. This is a static finding; I have not run the probe.
